     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem retina-conclusion-code-cs</b></p><a name=\"retina-conclusion-code-cs\"> </a><a name=\"hcretina-conclusion-code-cs\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>http://dips.no/fhir/RetinaIntegration/CodeSystem/retina-conclusion-code-cs</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1001<a name=\"retina-conclusion-code-cs-1001\"> </a></td><td>KI-gradering (basert på nåværende bilder)</td><td>This examination is waiting to be graded by the AI system.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1002<a name=\"retina-conclusion-code-cs-1002\"> </a></td><td>Primærgradering (basert på nåværende bilder)</td><td>This examinations is waiting to be graded by a primary grader.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1003<a name=\"retina-conclusion-code-cs-1003\"> </a></td><td>Sekundærgradering (basert på nåværende bilder)</td><td>This examination is waiting to be graded by a secondary grader.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1004<a name=\"retina-conclusion-code-cs-1004\"> </a></td><td>Ny fotokontroll (primærgradering)</td><td>Patient should be scheduled for a new routine eye examination graded by primary grader or AI.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1005<a name=\"retina-conclusion-code-cs-1005\"> </a></td><td>Ny fotokontroll (sekundærgradering)</td><td>Patient should be scheduled for a new routine eye examination but graded by secondary grader.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1006<a name=\"retina-conclusion-code-cs-1006\"> </a></td><td>Øyelegeundersøkelse (grunnet diabetisk retinopati)</td><td>Patient is leaving the screening program and should be referred to an ophthalmologist for further examination due to findings of diabetic retinopathy.</td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
